---
// Owner-supplied About copy; retain the existing composition and styling.
import Pursuits from "./Pursuits.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-side">
      <h2 id="about-heading" class="label" data-reveal="label">
        <span>About</span><span class="label-rule"></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="t-mono-s about-langs" data-reveal>
        Arabic native · English C1 · German A2 · Hungarian A1
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-main">
      <p class="t-display-2 about-lead" data-reveal="lines">
        I like building the parts of software that have to keep their promises.
      </p>
      <div class="prose about-body">
        <p data-reveal>
          I'm Michael, an Egyptian Computer Science student at ELTE in Budapest, graduating in
          July 2027. I started with C and Bash, explored Java and Python at university, and found
          my footing in full-stack development: building interfaces, designing APIs, and figuring
          out what happens between them.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          What interests me most is the engineering behind a feature that actually works.
          Authentication that stays secure when permissions change. Save files that restore
          exactly what they should. A game that knows when a move is legal. I enjoy tracing
          problems across an entire system, understanding why something breaks, and building
          a solution I can test and trust.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          My projects reflect that approach. I write about the decisions I made, the problems
          I encountered, what I tested, and what I'd do differently. There's always something
          worth learning from the parts that didn't go according to plan.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal>
          Outside of code, I play football, run, cycle, and swim. I also take coffee seriously
          enough to argue about it. Budapest is a pretty good city for all five.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* a visual index of the sentence above — the same five, nothing added */}
      <div data-reveal>
        <Pursuits />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    max-width: 68rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 13rem minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-6);
    }
  }
  .about-side {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }
  .about-langs {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .about-lead {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .about-body {
    max-width: var(--measure-wide);
    column-gap: var(--space-7);
  }
  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .about-body {
      columns: 2;
    }
    .about-body p {
      break-inside: avoid;
    }
  }
</style>
